788
00:30:01,733 --> 00:30:02,867
Me? Of course you did.

789
00:30:03,535 --> 00:30:04,669
How could I not?

790
00:30:05,336 --> 00:30:07,939
I tried to be
as nonchalant as I could today.

791
00:30:08,006 --> 00:30:11,543
-Why's that?
-But I felt things traveling with you.

792
00:30:12,477 --> 00:30:13,511
I felt relief,

793
00:30:14,445 --> 00:30:16,381
and I'm just having such a great time.

794
00:30:16,881 --> 00:30:17,949
Everything's perfect.

795
00:30:20,018 --> 00:30:20,919
What's so funny?

796
00:30:20,985 --> 00:30:22,220
How did you eat this?

797
00:30:23,021 --> 00:30:24,956
Did you pierce the back of your throat?

798
00:30:25,456 --> 00:30:26,357
Let me check.

799
00:30:26,424 --> 00:30:28,326
Is the back of your throat… What's this?

800
00:30:28,393 --> 00:30:29,594
There's a massive hole!

801
00:30:30,361 --> 00:30:31,196
This is…

802
00:30:31,262 --> 00:30:33,865
IS MY NECK OKAY?

803
00:30:33,932 --> 00:30:34,833
Oh, there's…

804
00:30:34,899 --> 00:30:35,967
I think I pierced it.

805
00:30:36,467 --> 00:30:38,102
TRAVEL BUDDIES GET FULL MARKS FOR HUMOR

806
00:30:38,169 --> 00:30:40,038
Where would I find
such a hilarious travel buddy?

807
00:30:40,104 --> 00:30:42,473
I was asking myself how I ate it,
and I've honestly forgotten.

808
00:30:42,540 --> 00:30:43,708
I guess I just shoved it in.

809
00:30:43,775 --> 00:30:44,876
Let's swap now.

810
00:30:44,943 --> 00:30:47,111
Sorry, I ate almost all of it.
It's down to the stick.

811
00:30:48,279 --> 00:30:49,180
I'm sorry.

812
00:30:49,681 --> 00:30:50,982
YUM

813
00:30:51,049 --> 00:30:53,051
-What do you want to do tomorrow?
-Tomorrow?

814
00:30:53,685 --> 00:30:57,522
We didn't get to drink Harbin beer today,
so I'd like to go to the museum.

815
00:30:57,589 --> 00:30:58,623
How about you?

816
00:30:59,490 --> 00:31:00,925
I'll just follow you.

817
00:31:00,992 --> 00:31:03,728
I'd also like to drink Harbin beer
at the museum.

818
00:31:03,795 --> 00:31:04,629
And?

819
00:31:04,696 --> 00:31:08,600
The Harbin Institute of Technology,
the school I attended.

820
00:31:08,666 --> 00:31:10,835
-I'd like to look around.
-Right, sounds good.

821
00:31:10,902 --> 00:31:13,371
-Harbin's also famous for guobaorou.
-Right.

822
00:31:13,872 --> 00:31:14,973
-How's that sound?
-Good.

823
00:31:15,039 --> 00:31:16,641
Today will be another jam-packed day.

824
00:31:16,708 --> 00:31:18,676
I'll just eat these three apples
before we go.

825
00:31:20,044 --> 00:31:21,980
RESUMES THE TANGHULU TEST

826
00:31:22,480 --> 00:31:24,148
SHE'S NOT VOMITING

827
00:31:24,983 --> 00:31:27,218
It's so childish but hilarious.

828
00:31:27,285 --> 00:31:28,553
I love this sort of stuff.

829
00:31:28,620 --> 00:31:29,854
-You do? That's good.
-Yes.

830
00:31:29,921 --> 00:31:30,855
Just leave me one.

831
00:31:31,389 --> 00:31:32,657
-Of these? Okay.
-Yes.

832
00:31:32,724 --> 00:31:34,025
You eat them and leave me one.

833
00:31:34,092 --> 00:31:35,493
CRUNCH

834
00:31:36,060 --> 00:31:36,895
Eat it.

835
00:31:36,961 --> 00:31:38,596
HOLD THIS, PLEASE

836
00:31:39,197 --> 00:31:42,901
WHATEVER YOU DO, I DO TOO

837
00:31:43,902 --> 00:31:46,304
BONDING THROUGH CHOKING

838
00:31:46,371 --> 00:31:47,872
Can you edit it

839
00:31:47,939 --> 00:31:49,340
so it's like we're in a rom-com?

840
00:31:49,407 --> 00:31:50,775
Sure, why not?

841
00:31:51,542 --> 00:31:53,912
-Was that too high-pitched?
-Yes.

842
00:31:53,978 --> 00:31:54,879
"Can you edit…"

843
00:31:55,446 --> 00:31:58,082
"Can you edit it
so it's like we're in a rom-com?"

844
00:31:58,149 --> 00:31:59,250
ASK AND YOU SHALL RECEIVE

845
00:31:59,317 --> 00:32:00,551
What should I call you?

846
00:32:01,519 --> 00:32:02,620
Nuna?

847
00:32:02,687 --> 00:32:04,322
Nuna. Did I make you blush today?

848
00:32:04,389 --> 00:32:05,823
I'll follow you, Nuna.

849
00:32:05,890 --> 00:32:07,292
SHE STARTED OFF AS HIS NUNA

850
00:32:09,861 --> 00:32:11,296
-Why are you doing that?
-Gen Z.

851
00:32:11,362 --> 00:32:12,730
-Gen Zs post like this?
-Yes.

852
00:32:12,797 --> 00:32:14,599
It truly feels like I'm on holiday.

853
00:32:14,666 --> 00:32:17,302
It's so surreal
that I'm walking this street right now.

854
00:32:17,368 --> 00:32:18,369
THEN THE TWO GROW CLOSER

855
00:32:18,436 --> 00:32:19,537
Be careful. Come here.

856
00:32:20,271 --> 00:32:22,073
When I meet you,

857
00:32:22,140 --> 00:32:24,242
I think all my senses come to life.

858
00:32:24,309 --> 00:32:25,143
Honey?

859
00:32:25,710 --> 00:32:27,345
ONCE SHE STARTED TO OPEN HER HEART

860
00:32:27,412 --> 00:32:29,213
Thank you so much, honey.

861
00:32:29,280 --> 00:32:31,549
NUNA SOON BECAME HONEY

862
00:32:35,720 --> 00:32:39,924
WHILE TRAVELING,
THE PAIR RUB OFF ON ONE ANOTHER

863
00:32:41,993 --> 00:32:42,994
I'm already excited.

864
00:32:43,061 --> 00:32:44,529
I don't think I'll be able to sleep.

865
00:32:44,595 --> 00:32:45,630
AND SO WE BECAME HONEY

866
00:32:45,697 --> 00:32:48,533
Tomorrow, I'll come to you
a little less carefully.

867
00:32:48,599 --> 00:32:49,634
Me too.

868
00:32:51,836 --> 00:32:53,538
I practiced saying good night.
Can I try it?

869
00:32:53,604 --> 00:32:55,273
-Please.
-Good night.

870
00:32:55,340 --> 00:32:56,407
-Hey.
-That's it, right?

871
00:32:56,474 --> 00:32:57,709
-Good night.
-Good night.

872
00:32:58,276 --> 00:32:59,277
HANDS CLASPED

873
00:32:59,344 --> 00:33:00,812
Now, let's go.

874
00:33:00,878 --> 00:33:04,649
RELUCTANT TO LET GO

875
00:33:05,750 --> 00:33:07,919
-Let's go.
-I thought you'd be staying here.

876
00:33:10,355 --> 00:33:12,357
I thought this was Will You Be There.

877
00:33:13,958 --> 00:33:14,959
This was fun.

878
00:33:15,860 --> 00:33:16,694
BYE

879
00:33:17,261 --> 00:33:18,763
WHAT MIGHT THEY GET UP TO TOMORROW…?

880
00:33:18,830 --> 00:33:20,898
-I'll try to be less careful tomorrow.
-Me too.

881
00:33:23,835 --> 00:33:24,669
I'll give you this.

882
00:33:24,736 --> 00:33:25,670
COOKIE-BARI

883
00:33:25,737 --> 00:33:27,338
TOUCHED

884
00:33:27,405 --> 00:33:28,673
-I'm not cold at all.
-Really?

885
00:33:29,173 --> 00:33:30,575
You look pretty cold.

886
00:33:32,143 --> 00:33:34,278
I'M FREEZING

887
00:33:34,345 --> 00:33:35,179
I'm just joking.

888
00:33:35,246 --> 00:33:36,180
Wear mine.

889
00:33:37,448 --> 00:33:39,050
THERE'S NO NEED

890
00:33:39,817 --> 00:33:41,519
I told you I was just joking.

891
00:33:41,586 --> 00:33:42,720
I'm not cold at all.

892
00:33:42,787 --> 00:33:44,422
-Please.
-Let's switch.

893
00:33:45,089 --> 00:33:46,958
NOT A BAD SHOUT

894
00:33:47,525 --> 00:33:48,493
That suits you so well.

895
00:33:48,559 --> 00:33:50,028
I'm sure you'll suit that too.

896
00:33:50,795 --> 00:33:53,598
YO-HAN LOOKS DAPPER IN DO-YEON'S JACKET

897
00:33:53,664 --> 00:33:54,499
Let's go.

898
00:33:57,502 --> 00:33:59,570
SWEET

899
00:34:00,338 --> 00:34:01,472
You're Tang Wei now.

900
00:34:03,374 --> 00:34:08,713
AND SO THEY RETURNED SAFELY TO THEIR HOTEL
